-- title:
--   A terminal CFZ certificate persists through iteration
-- statement:
--   Let $N\ne0$, fix a real function $\nu$ on $\mathbb Z/N\mathbb Z$ and a distinguished face $j$, and let $S$ be a majorized cut system over finite parameter and value types with arity $n+r$. A terminal CFZ certificate for $S$ gives one for $\mathrm{iterNext}(r,S)$ after $r$ successive steps.
